            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe trigger polls the **first organization** of the account (Organization left empty) every 5 minutes, so the run takes up to ~6 minutes. The provoking post is a **draft** on the first channel and is deleted at the end.\n\nRun this flow alone: a post created in the organization by another flow at the same time also fires the trigger and fails the assertion."
